# Authored in OSRS journal style from the OSRS Wiki walkthrough (no Wiki journal transcript); stages pinned to the server's quest states.
before	<col=000080>I can start this quest by talking to the <col=800000>Odd Old Man</col> in <col=800000>Silvarea</col>, north-east of <col=800000>Varrock</col> by the <col=800000>Limestone Mine</col>.</col>
