step	1	1	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080>I met the <col=800000>Odd Old Man</col> in <col=800000>Silvarea</col>. He collects bones and asked me to bring him eight polished ones: from a <col=800000>Goblin</col>, a <col=800000>Bear</col>, a <col=800000>Big frog</col>, a <col=800000>Ram</col>, a <col=800000>Unicorn</col>, a <col=800000>Monkey</col>, a <col=800000>Giant rat</col> and a <col=800000>Giant bat</col>. To polish a bone I need a pot of <col=800000>Vinegar</col> from <col=800000>Fortunato</col> in <col=800000>Draynor Village</col>; I put the bone in it and boil it on the old man's pot-boiler, using logs and a tinderbox. I can hand the polished bones over as I go.</col>
done	<str>I met the Odd Old Man in Silvarea. He collects bones and asked me to bring him eight polished ones: from a Goblin, a Bear, a Big frog, a Ram, a Unicorn, a Monkey, a Giant rat and a Giant bat.</str>
done	<str>I brought all eight polished bones to the Odd Old Man, who was delighted with his new collection.</str>
done	<col=ff0000>QUEST COMPLETE!</col>
